# A command that cannot be prepared (an argument too long): the record, the entry is processed in memory and never
# saved by the notification; nothing is spawned. A repeat's entry alike, and the wait that follows it finds no
# execution.
database real
rules tests/corpus/notify/format-fail.conf
chart loop.n loop.n_name loop.notify disks things 1
var loop.n v 10
clock 0
pass 0
var loop.n v 70
clock 1
pass 1
clock 2
pass 2
clock 3
pass 3
var loop.n v 10
clock 4
pass 4
clock 5
alarm-log 0
